# Android player contract (FROZEN)

```tsx
const useEmbed =
  YOUTUBE_IFRAME_PLAYER ||
  (Capacitor.isNativePlatform() && Capacitor.getPlatform() === 'android')
if (useEmbed) return <CleanPlayerYoutubeIframe {...props} /> // plain iframe, enablejsapi=0
return <CleanPlayerMediaBridge {...props} /> // web only
```

**FORBIDDEN on Android:** `CleanPlayerMediaBridge`, googlevideo `el.src`, hls.js, IFrame API custom controls.
